QuestGuidance.Register("en",153,{
[4865]="7000C0B0\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Ally of the Wardens of Annúminas.\n",
[4866]="7000C0B1\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered Kindred to the Wardens of Annúminas.\n",
[4867]="7002D3CA\n1\tFollow the road further into Moria\tThe road heads east from Wegil and makes towards the Dolven-view. You should follow the road towards the Dolven-view and stop to speak with any dwarf-travellers you see along the way.\n",
[4868]="7002D5A2\n1\tCollect a bucket of well water\tThe trick is, Billy, Bobby, Lizzie and Henry are finicky about who gets attention first, so we need to be careful to do them in the right order. They can be found in their stalls centred around the well here at the horse farm.\n2\tCollect a bucket of well water\tThe trick is, Billy, Bobby, Lizzie and Henry are finicky about who gets attention first, so we need to be careful to do them in the right order. They can be found in their stalls centred around the well here at the horse farm.\n3\tCollect a bucket of well water\tThe trick is, Billy, Bobby, Lizzie and Henry are finicky about who gets attention first, so we need to be careful to do them in the right order. They can be found in their stalls centred around the well here at the horse farm.\n4\tCollect a bucket of well water\tThe trick is, Billy, Bobby, Lizzie and Henry are finicky about who gets attention first, so we need to be careful to do them in the right order. They can be found in their stalls centred around the well here at the horse farm.\n5\tReturn to Éogar at Hengstacer Farm\tÉogar is awaiting your return near the stables of the horse farm.\n",
[4869]="7000383A\n1\tCollect Ingot of Dwarf-gold (total: 12)\tGoblins carrying dwarf-gold ingots can likely be found on the Pinnath Fenui, the ridges east of the source of the Bruinen, in the Misty Mountains. Larus Sharpshard is outraged that goblins have pilfered from the strongbox you recovered and has demanded that you retrieve all of the stolen ingots.\n2\tBring dwarf-gold ingots to Larus Sharpshard\tLarus Sharpshard is located at a camp north of High Crag. Larus Sharpshard will be delighted that you have recovered the stolen ingots from the goblins of the Misty Mountains.\n",
[4870]="70071DFE\n1\tDefeat goblins in Glúkroz (total: 14)\030Destroy goblin cauldrons in Glúkroz (total: 7)\030Destroy goblin catapults in Glúkroz (total: 5)\tDefeat goblins and destroy catapults and cauldrons in Glúkroz.\n2\tDefeat Korutásh in Glúkroz\tFind and defeat Korutásh, leader of the goblins in Glúkroz.\n",
[4871]="7006D1C2\n1\tDefeat Ordâkhai (total: 12)\030Destroy Ordâkhai tents (total: 3)\tDefeat the Ordâkhai and burn their tents to run them out of Omboha.\n2\tDefeat Bodhóri\tYou have defeated many Ordâkhai and burned their tents. An Ordâkhai champion has come forth to challenge you. You should answer his challenge.\n",
[4872]="7002EE38\n1\tCollect evidence of the invasion\t\n2\tCollect evidence of the invasion\tSupply boxes can be found throughout Maustazg, east of Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale. You should look in the supply boxes of the Orcs for something indicating the cause of the invasion.\n3\tBring the Orcs' orders to Ingmar in the Mead Hall of Eaworth\tIngmar is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth, north-west of Maustazg. You should bring the Orcs' orders back to Ingmar.\n",
[4873]="7002EE46\n1\tCollect evidence of the invasion\t\n2\tCollect evidence of the invasion\tSupply boxes can be found throughout the Orc-camp of Maustazg, east of Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale. You should search supply boxes for the cause of the Orcs' invasion.\n3\tBring the Orcs' orders to Góda at the Mead Hall of Eaworth\tGóda is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth, north-west of Maustazg. You should bring the Orcs' orders to Góda.\n",
[4874]="7002D06A\n1\tTalk to Gadda\tGadda is at the abandoned farm near the Eorlsmead Tower. You should bring the evidence you found to Gadda.\n",
[4875]="7002727F\n1\tBring the evil object to Saeradan at the Rohirrim scout-camp\tSaeradan is at the Rohirrim scout-camp. You should bring the evil object to Saeradan for his examination.\n",
[4876]="70028452\n1\tCollect evil devices (total: 6)\tThe strange devices can be found among the workings of Isengard. Dagoras asked you to destroy and collect the fell devices from the workings of Isengard.\n2\tBring the devices to Dagoras within Isengard\tDagoras is hidden within Isengard. You should return to Dagoras with the parts you collected.\n",
[4877]="700195B2\n1\tDefeat Blue-crag goblins at Dol Ringwest (total: 8)\tMake your way to the ruins of Dol Ringwest, west of Duillond, and purge the goblins who have infested them. Bregar wants to see the sanctity of the ruins returned and asked you to destroy the goblins who dwell within the ruins of Dol Ringwest.\n2\tTalk to Bregar at Duillond\tBregar is at Duillond, east of Dol Ringwest. Goblins infested the ruins of Dol Ringwest, and you did your best to drive the creatures forth from there.\n",
[4878]="7000A8F8\n1\tDefeat spirits in Ost Elendil (total: 30)\tFell spirits and their Angmarim masters can be found in Ost Elendil, beyond the bridge of Ariant. Legrindavor has asked you to defeat the fell spirits inside Ost Elendil and bring him the blood-stained runes used by the Angmarim there to command them.\n",
[4879]="70027298\n1\tBring the evil tokens to Saeradan at the Rohirrim scout-camp\tSaeradan is at the Rohirrim scout-camp, north-east of the Tree of Tribute. You should bring the tokens you found to Saeradan.\n",
[4880]="7001A495\n1\tDefeat spiders in the south-east Old Forest (total: 12)\030Collect the forester's pack\tThe spider-nest lies near the Willow Glade, to the south of Gillemin's old camp. Gillemin has asked you to gather some friends and investigate the spider-nest he found.\n2\tBring the pack to Gillemin Brandybuck in the Old Forest\tGillemin Brandybuck awaits you at his new camp, south-east of Old Muddyfoot's Hill. You should bring the pack you found to Gillemin Brandybuck.\n",
[4881]="700076B8\n1\tDefeat Sambrog in the Great Barrow\tSambrog is at the furthest end of the Great Barrow, in the deepest halls. Naerandir has asked you to defeat the ancient wight-lord Sambrog.\n2\tReturn to Naeradir outside of the Great Barrow\tNaerandir is awaiting further word of your deeds outside of the Great Barrow. You should return to Naerandir and tell him that Sambrog is slain.\n",
[4882]="70070220\n1\tCollect useful samples of the blight outside Starkhaven (total: 6)\030Defeat creatures from Adagím that have slipped into Sûg Nidar (total: 8)\tCúridwan has identified some locations outside Starkhaven where the blight has crept into Sûg Nidar, along with some creatures from Adagím.\n2\tBring the useful blight samples to Cúridwan by the entrance to the blighted vale outside Starkhaven\tCúridwan is outside the blighted vale located outside the eastern entrance to Starkhaven, in Sûg Nidar.\n",
[4883]="7005516E\n1\tDefeat nameless creatures in the Wracking-hall (total: 12)\tThe Wracking-hall can be found in the Circle of Death. You have encountered nameless creatures in the Wracking-hall of Minas Morgul. You should defeat them.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many of the nameless creatures in the Wracking-hall.\n",
[4884]="7006E967\n1\tComplete Umbar or Ikorbân raids on tier 2 or higher (total: 3)\tThe evils within The Depths of Mâkhda Khorbo and The Temple of Utug-bûr must be stopped. Complete three Umbar or Ikorbân raids on tier 2 or higher.\n2\tReturn to the Temple of Utug-bûr Quartermaster\tReturn to the Temple of Utug-bûr Quartermaster with proof of your victory.\n",
[4885]="7000979B\n1\tDefeat bats in Parth Aduial (total: 8)\030Defeat barghests in Parth Aduial (total: 6)\tBats and barghests can be found in Parth Aduial, especially near the pass leading to the Fields of Fornost. Forchon has expressed his distrust of you, but might become less hostile if you fulfill his request.\n2\tTalk to Forchon\tRanger Forchon is at the Ranger-camp on the island of Tinnudir, in Evendim. You have defeated bats and barghests in Parth Aduial, as Forchon requested. The Ranger waits to hear of your success.\n",
[4886]="70019713\n1\tDefeat Dourhands at Kheledúl (total: 8)\tKheledûl lies below the tower where Sigurdór waits. Sigurdór asked you to make your way to Kheledúl to exact vengeance on the Dourhand dwarves for his slain brother.\n2\tTalk to Sigurdór\tSigurdór is at the tower outside Kheledúl. You exacted vengeance upon the murderous Dourhand dwarves responsible for slaying Sigurdór's brother, Arndór. Now you should return to Sigurdór.\n",
[4887]="70065FA2\n1\tExamine the old record book\tDervorin would like your help examining old records. Examine records in the Crossing-hall.\n2\tExamine the tattered record book\tDervorin would like your help examining old records. Examine records in the Crossing-hall.\n3\tExamine the weathered record book\t\n4\tTalk to Dervorin\tDervorin is in the Crossing-hall. Talk to Dervorin.\n",
[4888]="70052988\n1\tGather eggs (total: 12)\tEggs can be found at the Beorninghús. You should collect some eggs for Gírta.\n2\tBring the eggs to Gírta\tGírta can be found at the Beorninghús. You should bring the eggs to Gírta.\n",
[4889]="700147D2\n1\tGive your ashen horse to Cam\tCam Applewood is at the Hengstacer Farm, north of the Bree Festival Grounds. Cam suggested you take a moment to consider whether or not you wish to exchange your horse. If you decide you do want to exchange your horse, you should speak to Cam again.\n",
[4890]="700147D6\n1\tGive your ashen pony to Cam\tCam Applewood is at the Hengstacer Farm, north of the Bree Festival Grounds. Cam suggested you take a moment to consider whether or not you wish to exchange your horse. If you decide you do want to exchange your horse, you should speak to Cam again.\n",
[4891]="7000B2AB\n1\tGive your bay horse to Cam\tCam Applewood is at the Hengstacer Farm, north of the Bree Festival Grounds. Cam suggested you take a moment to consider whether or not you wish to exchange your horse. If you decide you do want to exchange your horse, you should speak to Cam again.\n",
